WEBVTT

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:17.990
I got it!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.620
Kaos-chan?!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.920
Koyume-chan...

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.250
I'm sorry.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.490
More importantly, are you okay?

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.300
It looked like something was right there...

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.230
I don't see anything.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.090
Found you...

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:21.270
Comic Girls

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.660
Looks like it's all clear.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.950
Let's just have some ice cream 
and forget all about it.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:41.930
Otay...

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:46.000
It's been so hot, lately.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.810
Yes...

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:50.390
I'm really scared of ghosts!

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.370
Don't worry.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.940
I'm sure you were just imagining things.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.800
Come to think of it, isn't there a saying 
like "Ghosts start with worry?"

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.660
What's wrong, Kaos-chan?

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.640
Don't you believe in ghosts?

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.810
Ruki-san!

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.550
What's wrong, Kaos-chan?

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.780
There's a ghost...

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:33.890
Ghost?

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:35.290
Are you sure you're
not imagining things?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.070
No!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.260
It had really long hair that was all black...

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.020
You couldn't see its face and 
its hair flowed everywhere!

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:44.530
I'm sure you just saw a manga artist that 
dumped a bunch of ink over their head.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.770
That'd be concerning for a 
completely different reason...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.970
Let's calm down a bit.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.790
Okay...

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.550
I just remembered that I left 
Koyume-chan with the ghost!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.220
Huh?

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.550
Oh, no!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.280
Koyume-chan's going to be cursed!

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.770
That feels so nice!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.520
Right? My body's so cold.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.480
They're getting along.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.640
Fuura-senpai.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.890
Ruki-chan and Tsu-chan!

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.070
You know each other?

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:20.030
She was our senpai and looked after us 
when we first came to the dorm.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.980
I'm Suzu Fuura, a second-year in high school.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.530
I'm a horror manga artist.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.700
Didn't you go back home?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.780
They're my besties!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.370
Sure doesn't look that way...

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.750
By the way,

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:38.210
was the one screaming earlier in 
that splendid voice this little one?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.900
Her name's Kaos-chan!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.340
So your name is Kaos-chan!

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.460
Your hair is so long and pretty.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.930
They say that people with long hair 
tend to have strong spiritual powers,

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:52.330
so ghosts would probably 
love you, Kaos-chan...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.400
I'm going to shave all my hair off!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.400
Don't do anything rash!

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.620
Is she going to be okay?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.170
So cold!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.980
I'll never have to worry about 
really hot nights again!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.400
And I think she might be 
a little too okay with this...

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>Fuura-senpai...</i>

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.730
<i>She's scary.</i>

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.210
<i>I need to make sure I don't run into her.</i>

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.300
Kaos-chan was pretty freaked out...

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.480
Yeah, I can't really blame her.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.010
Fuura-senpai does have a habit 
of appearing out of nowhere...

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.220
Yeah...

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.500
I'll warn Kaos-chan to be on her guard.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.840
Especially...

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.900
Good morning...

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.380
About the fact that she likes showing 
up behind people in mirrors...

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.110
Too late.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.750
Kaos-chan, here...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.700
Cookies!

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.160
No!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.250
Kaos-chan, you must really love them!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:10.220
Dolls, that is... I love them, too.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.210
No!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.980
Kaos-chan, want some?

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.000
No...

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:26.230
I can draw such wonderful 
pictures when I hear you scream!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:31.200
Kaos-chan? Hey, Kaos-chan.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:31.810
Oh?

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.450
Kaos-chan!

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.960
Somosan! Seppa! Johakyu!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.360
That's not even a spell!

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:41.250
Not to mention, Senpai isn't a ghost 
to begin with, so that's just rude!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.650
Eek! I'm going to be purified!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.410
Please stop!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.610
Uh, actually, she seems
to be enjoying the attention...

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.050
This is your chance! Run!

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.480
I'm so scared!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.000
You scream so much that 
she's taken a liking to you.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.440
Please save me, Ruki-san.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:02.220
Come to think of it, she followed 
Rukki around a lot at first, too.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:05.100
Even when I was sleeping,

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.720
or in the bath...

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.740
No matter how much I'd try to lose her...

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:13.840
I thought I was going to go insane,

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:17.480
but I still managed to draw this.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:21.080
<i>The Stalker Wife 24</i>

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:21.080
It's amazing that you managed to 
use that experience in your work!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:24.540
That's how Rukki managed to
get through all of it, but...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.510
Fuura-senpai appears, 
blowing her horn...

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:31.240
I'm going to end up being 
Fuura-senpai's sacrifice!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:31.230
Kaos isn't going to even be able 
to draw manga at this rate...

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:33.760
The only way to get Fuura-senpai 
to forget about her

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.480
is for her to steel her heart and ignore her!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:41.680
Will this work?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:42.900
Yes.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.790
We can't let her in, no matter what.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.640
Okay.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:07.250
Kaos-chan, you're here, aren't you?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.620
No!

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.970
Let me in!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.920
No!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.920
Open up!

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:19.020
I'm scared of thunder!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.050
And I'm scared of you!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.030
Please...

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.570
Open up...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.130
I'm so lonely by myself!

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.360
I finally... came back to the dorm...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.080
but the girl I was rooming with is gone!

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.280
I'm so alone...

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.050
I don't really know...

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.410
how to interact...

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:58.670
with others... very... well...

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.600
I'm so awkward...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.760
That's why you're all avoiding me.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.820
That feeling...

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.610
I sort of...

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.060
Kaos-chan!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:17.730
Wait!

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:18.950
Don't open the door!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.830
I understand!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:26.640
I-If everyone had left me out,

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.630
I would've been alone, too,

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.630
so I can't leave her alone!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:49.420
It's no use. Kaos-chan's just too nice.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:52.480
At this rate, Kaos might 
disappear from the dorm...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.060
No...

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.480
You're scary, after all!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.990
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.940
<i>She's slender, but her chest is pretty big...</i>

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:03.840
<i>I see!</i>

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.370
Kaos-chan...

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.620
Yes?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.600
<i>Now that I got a good look 
at her, she's really pretty.</i>

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:16.760
<i>Huh? What is this unexpected difference?</i>

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.710
Will you be my friend?

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:22.600
Y-Yes!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.850
Thank you!

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:29.410
Did... the nuance of her screams change?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.540
Yes?

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.060
Hello, Fuura-senpai.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.100
Hello.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.540
Please, come in.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:45.810
Fuura-senpai, your skin is 
really fair and beautiful.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.260
You think so?

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:49.000
I don't really go outside...

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.370
You're always wearing such a cute dress!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.960
Where did you get it?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.960
Um... online...

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.600
Oh, really? What service did you use?

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:57.780
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:01.400
<i>Somehow, being treated normally 
is rather embarrassing...</i>

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:07.850
I wonder if Kaos-chan has a thing for 
mature-looking people acting needy towards her.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.150
Did a new rival appear?

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:12.130
It's not like that.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:16.140
But I'm glad that there's a 
place for Fuura-senpai now.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:19.560
Yeah. She's a bit different, 
but she's not a bad person.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.530
Thank you for worrying about me...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.520
There you are, evil spirit! Begone!

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:31.000
I'm so relieved
you two still reject me.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:37.000
Episode 6
"I'll Go Shave All My Hair Off!"

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:37.000
Eeeek

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:37.000
I made
some
chocolate
cake today...

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.800
You really are annoying...

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.990
<i>There should be clear skies 
all across the country.</i>

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.780
<i>And please take a look at this.</i>

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.770
<i>Here at Kochia Plaza, it's the perfect time to see 
all the kochia bushes in their full fall splendor.</i>

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:10.260
Those girls didn't see me, did they?

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:13.760
Yeah. I don't look like an otaku at all.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.060
It's okay.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.380
My secret hasn't been revealed.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.940
I'm heading out!

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:21.940
Have a good day!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.660
Did you end up staying up all night?

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.320
I was thinking about my storyboard...

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:37.990
Tsubasa-san, I heard that your ranking 
with the reader surveys went up.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:39.110
Yeah.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.470
I'm happy, but it's also a lot of pressure...

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:46.110
Not to mention, I want to actually hear 
people tell me why it went up.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:49.770
You'll probably fall asleep
in class at this rate, Tsu-chan.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:53.580
Nijino-sensei's really strict and 
scary, so you need to be careful.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.330
I'm pretty sure she hasn't figured out that

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.930
the reason Tsu-chan's falling asleep in 
class is because of her manga, but...

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.470
Good morning.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.770
Good morning.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.520
G-Good...

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.600
Moeta-san!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.620
You need to say your greetings 
loudly and with vigor!

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:12.980
I'm so sorry!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:18.350
<i>But you know, being scolded by beautiful 
teachers is a wonderful thing...</i>

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:21.120
Uh, Moeta-san? Why are you smiling?

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.880
Eek! I'm sorry!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.740
Please compose yourself.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.200
Tidy

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.200
Newly-appointed

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.200
Responsible

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.200
Notebook

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.200
Beautiful
and cute

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:29.420
Did you model that after Nijino-sensei?

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.200
Yes.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.740
I've been wanting to draw 
a character like this.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:35.500
That's great! Nijino-sensei 
is cute, after all!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.680
You did a good job.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.380
Why don't you make her chest a little bigger?

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.500
I think this is just right.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.510
<i>What are they whispering about?</i>

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.400
<i>It couldn't be...</i>

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:47.250
She might be acting like 
she's such a teacher, but...

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.250
She's a fan of the Dark Hero.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.380
She's pretty hardcore, too.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.600
So she's one of us.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.450
<i>That's right!</i>

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.930
<i>If they were there...</i>

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.810
Right now, she lacks any kind of gap.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.620
Gap? What would you do, then, Ruki-san?

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.060
Well...

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.440
<i>I need to know...</i>

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.820
Like seeming really serious, 
but wearing really sexy underwear.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.540
Is that true, Irokawa-san?

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.400
N-No, we weren't talking about me.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:11.090
All right,

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.880
we will now begin homeroom.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.450
<i>If they haven't found out 
about me, that's good.</i>

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:22.460
<i>But why were those girls there?</i>

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.470
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.610
<i>They're fans?</i>

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:26.560
<i>She's already asleep?</i>

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:28.060
Katsuki-san!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.290
Do you come to school just to sleep?

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:31.550
Tsubasa-san!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.220
Tsu-chan, Tsu-chan, wake up!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:35.220
<i>I guess I'll just ask them 
some casual questions, first.</i>

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.970
Please come with me!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.690
<i>I'll find out why, first.</i>

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.150
Hey, are you listening, Katsuki-san?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.440
Why are you so tired?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.730
<i>Are you watching late-night anime?</i>

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:50.700
Uh... Um...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.450
<i>I can't tell her that I'm 
drawing manga, no matter what.</i>

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.510
<i>I have to ask...</i>

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.450
Are you staying up late at night?

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.630
Uh, well, I...

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.980
<i>I can't tell her.</i>

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:07.900
This is exactly what I was worried would happen.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.050
Yes...

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.350
This just isn't fair for Tsubasa-san!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.950
Sensei, please don't be 
too angry at Tsubasa-san!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.300
She's really tired!

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:16.970
Koyume...

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.970
No, I can't allow napping 
to happen in my class.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.860
Then, if Tsubasa-san looks like 
she's about to fall asleep,

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.690
I'll pour her some coffee!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.170
Here, have a cup!

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.600
You're not even in my class!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.980
She totally has her eye 
on you now, Tsubasa-san.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.170
She asked me why I was napping,

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:43.160
but I couldn't tell her that 
I was up late drawing manga.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:49.600
Maybe you should go ahead and just 
tell Nijino-sensei the truth.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.470
I wonder if she'd accept that, though...

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:55.230
She's really responsible, 
so she might just lecture her.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.050
Stop drawing manga and study!

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:02.620
Getting lectured by a beautiful teacher...

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.820
Do you want to get yelled at, Kaos-chan?

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.720
Either way, I can't say anything.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.360
Because being a high-school girl author...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.870
doesn't fit with the image of shonen mangas...

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.330
Huh?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:22.040
Wing V's true identity must be kept a secret.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.650
Wing V...

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:24.690
Wing V...

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.870
Wing V...

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:28.930
Why did you all just repeat my pen name?

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.330
Uh, no reason.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:34.450
<i>Tsu-chan thinks it's actually cool, 
so it's hard to say anything.</i>

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.880
Anyway, at least try to stay awake during 
the next class with Nijino-sensei.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.310
Here, have some coffee!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.300
<i>Hey, Tsu-chan's actually 
being responsible and...</i>

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:49.610
<i>working?!</i>

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.930
It's not like you can do whatever you want
as long as you aren't sleeping, Tsu-chan!

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:55.370
But if I don't do this, 
I'll end up falling asleep...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.650
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.070
<i>It's all over!</i>

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:03.540
She's going to find out!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.410
I knew it!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:16.300
I think she might get 
into a lot of trouble.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.730
Well, from a teacher's point of view,

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.360
it probably just looks like doodling.

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:24.780
Katsuki-san, there's something 
I'd like to ask you.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:25.710
This...

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:31.050
C-Could it be that you like <i>The Dark Hero</i>, too?!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:31.690
Huh?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.410
Sensei!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.970
You've heard of it?

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.260
I-I've been following it since chapter one.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.280
I'm a huge fan of Wing V-sensei!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.360
Fan...

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:49.110
Katsuki-san, your illustration 
almost looks official...

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.330
Yes, well...

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.290
<i>So she </i>is<i> a fan!</i>

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.670
<i>I have to change the subject!</i>

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.150
Um...

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:59.210
What do you like about <i>The Dark Hero</i>?

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:01.280
Um, well,

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.180
I love both the art and story,

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.760
but the protagonist is so cute!

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.810
Cute? Not cool?

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.920
Yes! He's such a brat and 
his shorts are adorable!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.780
His kneecaps are the best!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.780
I see...

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.780
I guess I never thought about that before.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.280
<i>Wait, wait... I got all 
worked up without thinking.</i>

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:24.450
Um...

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.810
Do you happen to go to events, too?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:28.420
Huh?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.630
Or do you participate 
in things like that?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.460
I can't just sit here anymore!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.730
Um, Sensei!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.250
Moeta-san.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.030
Tsubasa-san is...

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:39.620
Yes?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.030
What?!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.580
Sensei!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.930
I-It's okay...

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:50.150
Wing V-sensei draws such 
wonderful illustrations...

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:51.640
So I was prepared to accept

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:55.110
whatever they might look like or what their 
personality might actually be like...

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.220
But the fact that she's a high school girl,

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:58.580
not to mention one of my students...

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.610
No, no, that just can't be!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:04.220
There's no way that Katsuki-san 
could be Wing V-sensei!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:05.330
But it's true!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.120
Tsubasa-san's amazing!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.300
I'm not so naïve as to let you fool me!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.010
But we're not!

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:12.550
Oh...

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:15.500
I'm not sure if this would be proof, but...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.960
This is the manuscript 
I finished this morning.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.960
Whack

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:21.380
Whack

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.470
Crash

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.070
S-S-S-Sensei!

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:32.190
Please forgive my rudeness!

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.130
You're the sensei...

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.000
May I ask you something?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:36.860
Yes?

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.540
Did you happen to go

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:43.040
to the anime event that was being held 
at the amusement park the other day?

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.200
No...

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:48.200
We did coincidentally go to the 
amusement park that day, though.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.960
<i>So they didn't find out!</i>

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:54.930
There are a lot of readers that 
think Wing V is a guy,

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:59.790
so I can't go to official gatherings 
like events or autograph signings.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.290
I-I see...

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:07.340
So please keep the fact 
that I'm Wing V a secret.

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.540
Of course!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.100
Also, um...

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.420
It made me really happy...

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.560
Huh?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.960
This was the first time I actually 
got to hear directly from a fan.

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:22.030
Thank you so much for your support.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.780
Of course!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.200
The flawless female teacher 
has a thing for kneecaps...

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.330
Wait...

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.010
What's with this gap?

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.450
All four of you are manga artists?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:38.000
So that's why you're 
always napping and so tired.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.760
You should've told me sooner!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:42.240
We clearly missed our chance to bring it up.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:46.010
We actually all live in a dorm together.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.410
<i>A manga artist dorm...</i>

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:53.640
<i>I could've sworn someone 
told me about one before...</i>

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:57.110
Wait, so the matron is...

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.590
Yes, it's me.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:01.860
My girls go to your school.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.070
<i>They seem really busy, 
so please take care of them.</i>

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.520
You should've told me, you idiot!

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.830
Sorry, I totally forgot.

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:12.900
I guess your true identity's been revealed.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:13.760
Yes.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:17.870
Maybe that means that Nijino-sensei 
will take it easy on you.

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:18.940
No, no.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:22.450
We still need to balance out 
drawing manga and studying.

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:23.760
Yeah...

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:28.340
<i>But to think that someone like 
Nijino-sensei loves manga...</i>

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.180
Is very lonely

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.180
Always together | Super pretty!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.180
Secretly
has big
boobs!!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.180
Has no legs

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.180
She's pale!
She's beautiful!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:31.180
<i>I know!</i>

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.140
So what's your theme today?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.840
Yes. It's "gap."

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:37.060
I think that's a great perspective.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.600
You do?

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:45.580
This lonely ghost that's actually really 
pretty, fair-skinned, and has big boobs,

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.930
along with the beautiful teacher 
who's really hardcore during the day,

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.860
but is actually a fan of shonen manga...

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:51.260
Those are excellent character layouts.

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:52.420
Yes!

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.540
But, most importantly, what's the story?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.110
Guess this is getting rejected, too.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Has big boobs!!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Super pretty
otaku teacher

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Miharu-sensei

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Really pretty!!
Really nice!!

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:32.640
Having someone relate to you feels so nice!

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:33.350
I know!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.080
I totally get it!

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.590
They're communicating with their eyes!

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time, "Is This Heaven!?"

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.020
Is This Heaven!?
